This derivative was prepared by the knowlet/Gemma-4-12B-Unified-System-One
project. It applies one epoch of LoRA fine-tuning on 2,048 English BoolQ
examples and merges the learned adapter into a complete BF16 checkpoint.
The package retains the source processor and native image/audio modules.
A scalar temperature fitted on 256 separate BoolQ calibration cases is
recorded in s1_config.json for the System One decision runtime.

