GGUF derivative and conversion
The merged source was converted directly to Q8_0 language-model weights
and an F16 projector retaining both native vision and audio components.
Conversion and the native S1 backend use llama.cpp by ggml-org and its
contributors, revision 5fc4f3c8c7103ffd0b7ff5ee4855bcc78a3ed5cd.
The S1 adapter and release evaluator are provided by this project's
source revision bcf829acc111fd8054987b1519b8181835f1dfed.
This package has its own scalar temperature fitted only to the 256
separate BoolQ calibration cases; base_s1_config.json preserves the
source BF16 calibration without modification. Evaluation and the
independent cross-runtime comparison are included as separate receipts.
